# Build output and editor caches must not reach the context: slow, and a
# stale class could be copied instead of one this build produced. The same
# set is excluded from the launcher jar's bundled copy of this directory
# (the resourceGenerators task in the repository root's build.sbt); keep the
# two in step. `**/`, because a bare name only matches at the context root
# and sbt writes .bsp under app/. .dockerignore rather than .containerignore
# because both podman and docker look for it.
**/target
**/project/project
**/.bsp
**/.scala-build
**/.bloop
**/.metals
**/.DS_Store
